  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-06T22:31:08.074Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "**Currently**, the right stick is used for turning left and right.\n**Suggestion:** Moving the stick up or down should lean the player's view forward or backward.\n**Why?** Horizon adjust lets us play VRChat while laying on our back. But vertical head movement is difficult in that position.\n**Concerns:** This might not be useful outside the scenario I described. Also, due to being unused, some world author use the vertical right stick axis for triggering Udon events.",
